WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:06.006
For more than 40 years, CNN has offered

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:06.806
a front row

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:09.109
seat to history in the making.

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.011
Why am I under arrest?

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.679
It's a hoax set up.

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:13.279
Join us

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:15.548
as we turn back the clock to expose

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:16.716
Osama bin Laden

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:17.951
and watch the stories

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:20.020
that have defined our time

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.122
There are no words to say O.J.

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:22.989
Simpson

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:28.261
This is CNN's Rewind

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:34.401
It was January 1991.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:35.201
The U.S.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:37.337
economy was sinking into recession.

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:39.239
Mob boss John Gotti,

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:40.273
the Teflon Don,

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:42.142
had recently been arrested on charges

00:00:42.142 --> 00:00:44.310
that would lead to life imprisonment.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:45.412
Macaulay Culkin

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:46.713
faced off with criminals

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.481
in the first home alone.

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.316
And President George H.W.

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:51.151
Bush edged

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:53.253
towards war in the Persian Gulf.

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:55.321
Then one early January

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:56.923
morning in Baghdad,

00:00:56.923 --> 00:01:00.627
CNN reported that the skies over Baghdad

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:02.929
have been illuminated with big

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:05.432
plans and missiles set up.

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:09.002
And an explosive development near

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:10.403
the Persian Gulf.

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:13.306
Word that Iraq has invaded neighboring

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:14.307
state of Kuwait,

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:16.509
where fighting reported along the border.

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:17.544
The residents say that

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:19.312
they were awakened by machine gunfire

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:21.381
and heavy artillery for weeks.

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:23.583
100,000 Iraqi troops have been reported

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:24.984
massing near the border.

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:25.819
Arab countries

00:01:25.819 --> 00:01:27.153
have been trying this month

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:29.355
to diffuse this building crisis.

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:30.490
In Washington,

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:31.891
the White House is condemning

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:32.792
the invasion,

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:33.660
calling for Iraq

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.929
to withdraw its forces immediately.

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:36.629
The U.S.

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:38.698
is also calling for an emergency. U.N.

00:01:38.698 --> 00:01:40.567
Security Council session.

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:42.635
The Security Council passed sanctions.

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:44.370
No more trade with Iraq.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.339
A boycott of Iraqi oil.

00:01:46.339 --> 00:01:47.974
A ban on arms sales.

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:50.410
A ban on financial aid and investment.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:52.378
But will the sanctions work?

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:53.746
Today, America

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:55.548
stops mulling over its options,

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:56.116
reportedly

00:01:56.116 --> 00:01:57.650
sending United States warplanes

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:59.652
and combat troops into Saudi Arabia.

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:01.554
We seek the immediate,

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:04.390
unconditional and complete withdrawal

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.726
of all Iraqi forces from Kuwait.

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:16.569
From the beginning of the Gulf crisis.

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:18.138
The underlying rationale

00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:20.940
for stopping Saddam Hussein has been oil.

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:23.409
The oil dependent world

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:24.878
doesn't want a single man

00:02:24.878 --> 00:02:25.778
with a big army

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:27.814
to control the flow from the Gulf

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:37.557
With the Operation Desert Shield deadline

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:39.092
less than three weeks away.

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:40.326
Diplomats and journalists

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:41.161
are ready to leap

00:02:41.161 --> 00:02:42.729
at any trace of activity

00:02:42.729 --> 00:02:45.265
that might lead to the bargaining table

00:02:45.265 --> 00:02:46.566
unless Saddam Hussein

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:48.735
withdraws from Kuwait by late winter.

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:49.202
The U.S.

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:50.837
will go to war

00:02:56.643 --> 00:02:57.443
The Bush White House

00:02:57.443 --> 00:02:58.845
now says war with Iraq

00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:00.547
could begin at any moment.

00:03:00.547 --> 00:03:02.448
It took six months to come to this.

00:03:02.448 --> 00:03:03.283
But as our senior

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:03.683
White House

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:05.952
correspondent Charles Bierbauer reports,

00:03:05.952 --> 00:03:06.686
President Bush

00:03:06.686 --> 00:03:08.488
believed early on in this crisis

00:03:08.488 --> 00:03:10.023
that it would ultimately be settled

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:10.723
with force

00:03:12.325 --> 00:03:13.259
White House officials

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:14.194
say even now,

00:03:14.194 --> 00:03:15.061
Saddam Hussein

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:16.062
could avoid a war

00:03:16.062 --> 00:03:18.097
with a massive pullout of his forces.

00:03:18.331 --> 00:03:18.665
And yet

00:03:18.665 --> 00:03:19.666
the Bush administration

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:21.334
does not expect that

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:22.202
Good evening or rather,

00:03:22.202 --> 00:03:23.703
good morning from Saudi Arabia,

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:24.504
where it's now a quarter

00:03:24.504 --> 00:03:26.005
after two in the morning.

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:27.373
The latest briefing

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:27.974
we've received

00:03:27.974 --> 00:03:29.642
from the military command here in Saudi

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:31.878
Arabia was on the number of troops here.

00:03:31.878 --> 00:03:32.512
And apparently

00:03:32.512 --> 00:03:34.681
there's a total of 425,000 U.S.

00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:35.048
troops here.

00:03:35.048 --> 00:03:36.516
That's an increase of 10,000 over

00:03:36.516 --> 00:03:37.951
the last time we were briefed.

00:03:37.951 --> 00:03:39.419
The total multinational force

00:03:39.419 --> 00:03:41.521
here on the ground is about 690,000

00:03:55.969 --> 00:03:56.336
With us

00:03:56.336 --> 00:03:57.870
now is Caspar Weinberger,

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.005
secretary of defense

00:03:59.005 --> 00:04:00.940
during both Reagan administrations.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.642
Mr. Secretary, thank you for coming.

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:03.409
Thank you.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:04.143
Secretary one

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:05.011
where you were credited

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:06.980
with the military buildup, which

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:08.681
is being put to use.

00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:11.718
But there is one

00:04:11.818 --> 00:04:14.320
area which which has come to

00:04:14.954 --> 00:04:16.322
a lot of criticism.

00:04:16.322 --> 00:04:18.391
We have to go to Baghdad. Secretary.

00:04:18.791 --> 00:04:21.094
We're going to Bernard Shaw in Baghdad.

00:04:24.731 --> 00:04:25.865
This is

00:04:26.599 --> 00:04:29.068
something is happening outside of the

00:04:31.671 --> 00:04:32.972
Peter Arnett.

00:04:33.273 --> 00:04:34.007
Join me here.

00:04:34.007 --> 00:04:35.575
What let's describe to our viewers

00:04:35.575 --> 00:04:36.976
what we're seeing.

00:04:36.976 --> 00:04:37.944
The skies over

00:04:37.944 --> 00:04:40.313
Baghdad have been illuminated.

00:04:40.313 --> 00:04:42.548
We're seeing bright flashes

00:04:42.548 --> 00:04:44.617
going off all over the sky, Peter.

00:04:45.852 --> 00:04:48.321
Well, there's anti-aircraft

00:04:48.321 --> 00:04:51.591
gunfire going into the sky.

00:04:51.591 --> 00:04:53.893
However, we have not yet heard

00:04:53.893 --> 00:04:56.296
the sound of bombs landing,

00:04:56.296 --> 00:04:58.031
but there's tremendous

00:04:58.031 --> 00:04:59.699
lightning in the sky.

00:04:59.699 --> 00:05:00.833
I have a sense, Peter,

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:04.304
that people are shooting towards the sky

00:05:04.937 --> 00:05:06.739
and they are not aware

00:05:06.739 --> 00:05:08.975
or cannot see what they're shooting at.

00:05:08.975 --> 00:05:10.810
This is extraordinary.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:13.179
We're getting starbursts

00:05:13.179 --> 00:05:16.416
seeming starbursts in the black sky.

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:19.285
We have not heard any jet planes yet.

00:05:19.285 --> 00:05:19.619
Peter

00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:21.954
No point.

00:05:21.954 --> 00:05:24.123
Now the sirens are

00:05:24.123 --> 00:05:26.359
sounding for the first time.

00:05:26.359 --> 00:05:28.361
The Iraqis have informed us

00:05:35.234 --> 00:05:36.202
Well, we heard

00:05:36.202 --> 00:05:36.936
Peter Arnett saying

00:05:36.936 --> 00:05:38.671
the Iraqis have informed us

00:05:38.671 --> 00:05:39.939
and then we didn't hear any more.

00:05:39.939 --> 00:05:42.342
This is probably just a technical glitch.

00:05:42.508 --> 00:05:43.943
They have four wires there

00:05:43.943 --> 00:05:44.711
that they can use

00:05:44.711 --> 00:05:46.479
and those wires can be easily

00:05:46.479 --> 00:05:48.214
severed or pulled.

00:05:48.214 --> 00:05:49.515
Wolf, what have you for us

00:05:49.515 --> 00:05:51.017
at this moment?

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:52.652
There is strong indications

00:05:52.652 --> 00:05:53.486
here at the Pentagon

00:05:53.486 --> 00:05:56.589
that this war may be beginning right now

00:05:56.589 --> 00:05:57.690
and that the president

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:58.524
may be going on

00:05:58.524 --> 00:05:59.325
television later

00:05:59.325 --> 00:06:00.426
this evening to explain

00:06:00.426 --> 00:06:02.762
what exactly is going on.

00:06:02.762 --> 00:06:05.031
Wolf, let me just let me interrupt.

00:06:05.064 --> 00:06:06.299
I'm sorry to interrupt,

00:06:06.299 --> 00:06:07.900
but we're going back to Baghdad now

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:08.968
because we can

00:06:08.968 --> 00:06:10.436
and we have people are not out far away,

00:06:10.436 --> 00:06:12.271
but we are sending to them.

00:06:12.271 --> 00:06:14.340
Please come in to us from Baghdad.

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:15.975
This is David French in Washington.

00:06:19.545 --> 00:06:22.215
Well, Baghdad cruise lines, did

00:06:22.215 --> 00:06:24.317
they just cut the line

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:28.388
All right.

00:06:28.388 --> 00:06:30.189
We've lost that for the moment.

00:06:30.189 --> 00:06:32.859
Back to the Pentagon again.

00:06:32.859 --> 00:06:33.192
Wolf,

00:06:33.192 --> 00:06:34.260
you were just reporting

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:37.096
that there is new activity level.

00:06:37.096 --> 00:06:38.531
Hello, Atlanta.

00:06:38.698 --> 00:06:39.932
Atlanta, this is Holliman.

00:06:39.932 --> 00:06:40.733
I don't know whether you think

00:06:40.733 --> 00:06:42.502
you're able to hear me now or not,

00:06:42.502 --> 00:06:43.770
but I'm going to continue to talk to you

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:45.004
as long as I can.

00:06:45.004 --> 00:06:47.106
There have been some sirens here tonight,

00:06:47.106 --> 00:06:49.976
but we are we still have seen

00:06:49.976 --> 00:06:52.512
no sign of any airplanes coming in here.

00:06:53.312 --> 00:06:54.614
All we are seeing is the

00:06:54.614 --> 00:06:57.483
the Iraqi response from the ground, many,

00:06:57.784 --> 00:06:58.985
many troops around that.

00:06:58.985 --> 00:06:59.352
You can

00:06:59.352 --> 00:07:00.186
perhaps

00:07:00.186 --> 00:07:01.821
hear the sound of bombs

00:07:01.821 --> 00:07:03.489
in the background and all that.

00:07:03.489 --> 00:07:05.925
I've got a microphone out the window.

00:07:05.925 --> 00:07:07.527
I think you'll be able to hear the sound

00:07:21.507 --> 00:07:21.774
from

00:07:26.946 --> 00:07:29.315
the night sky of Baghdad

00:07:29.315 --> 00:07:30.016
time here

00:07:30.016 --> 00:07:31.951
about 20 minutes ago,

00:07:31.951 --> 00:07:33.653
three in the morning.

00:07:33.653 --> 00:07:35.188
I'm getting away from there,

00:07:35.188 --> 00:07:36.189
from the windows.

00:07:36.189 --> 00:07:37.890
I'm going to turn off the microphone

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.091
for one moment

00:07:39.091 --> 00:07:39.692
in an attempt

00:07:39.692 --> 00:07:40.726
to see if we can

00:07:40.726 --> 00:07:42.094
we can hear Atlanta

00:07:42.094 --> 00:07:43.930
and not get some response from

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:46.232
CNN down the line.

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:47.700
All right.

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:48.568
We're not immediately

00:07:48.568 --> 00:07:49.635
able to pick up

00:07:49.635 --> 00:07:50.803
to resume that sound

00:07:50.803 --> 00:07:52.538
from John Holman's position.

00:07:52.538 --> 00:07:54.407
So we will now return to the Pentagon,

00:07:54.407 --> 00:07:55.308
where Wolf

00:07:55.308 --> 00:07:58.377
Blitzer has some more for us Wolf.

00:07:58.377 --> 00:08:00.046
Yes, David, only moments ago,

00:08:00.046 --> 00:08:01.781
before I came into the studio

00:08:01.781 --> 00:08:02.515
here at the Pentagon,

00:08:02.515 --> 00:08:03.115
I had a chance

00:08:03.115 --> 00:08:06.219
to see two very senior Pentagon officials

00:08:06.486 --> 00:08:08.154
almost running through the halls,

00:08:08.154 --> 00:08:10.289
going up to Secretary Cheney's office.

00:08:10.623 --> 00:08:11.891
Let's go back to Baghdad

00:08:11.891 --> 00:08:12.859
and see what John Holliman

00:08:12.859 --> 00:08:14.427
is reporting in the meantime.

00:08:14.427 --> 00:08:15.495
There's a response here,

00:08:15.495 --> 00:08:17.430
as if the city were under attack,

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:19.732
the night sky filled with them

00:08:20.399 --> 00:08:21.601
with a hail of bullets

00:08:21.601 --> 00:08:23.369
and from anti-aircraft guns.

00:08:23.369 --> 00:08:24.337
And up in the distance,

00:08:24.337 --> 00:08:26.672
you can hear what appears to be

00:08:26.672 --> 00:08:27.874
bombs of some kind,

00:08:27.874 --> 00:08:29.041
hitting the ground or perhaps

00:08:29.041 --> 00:08:30.510
artillery shells hitting the ground.

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:32.211
They're allowed reports

00:08:32.211 --> 00:08:33.546
and you can feel the

00:08:33.546 --> 00:08:34.247
the building

00:08:34.247 --> 00:08:34.480
of this

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:37.884
very well, Bill, hotel shaking underneath

00:08:38.317 --> 00:08:41.087
as the heavy attack apparently continues.

00:08:41.888 --> 00:08:42.421
Hi there.

00:08:42.421 --> 00:08:43.289
Is it possible to call

00:08:43.289 --> 00:08:44.357
the United States, please,

00:08:45.358 --> 00:08:45.925
back in an

00:08:45.925 --> 00:08:46.926
open microphone

00:08:46.926 --> 00:08:49.095
from Baghdad, from the hotel,

00:08:49.095 --> 00:08:52.031
now being a hotel room, now being left,

00:08:52.031 --> 00:08:53.399
we believe, by Bernard Shaw,

00:08:53.399 --> 00:08:53.966
Peter Arnett,

00:08:53.966 --> 00:08:55.801
John Holliman and Anderson Porter

00:08:55.801 --> 00:08:57.236
support staff there.

00:08:57.236 --> 00:08:59.272
There is a bomb shelter in that hotel.

00:08:59.272 --> 00:09:01.274
We heard them report earlier today.

00:09:01.541 --> 00:09:04.610
Back to the Pentagon and Wolf Blitzer.

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:05.478
David, all day long,

00:09:05.478 --> 00:09:06.579
we've been hearing rumors

00:09:06.579 --> 00:09:08.648
that the attack would start at night,

00:09:08.648 --> 00:09:10.049
Baghdad time,

00:09:10.049 --> 00:09:10.750
that the attack,

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:11.150
if it did

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:13.419
come, would try to take advantage of U.S.

00:09:13.419 --> 00:09:14.854
night fighting equipment

00:09:14.854 --> 00:09:16.122
especially with the radar

00:09:16.122 --> 00:09:17.690
evading stealth fighters.

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:19.392
And that is backed up by indications

00:09:19.392 --> 00:09:21.093
that we're getting here in the Pentagon.

00:09:21.093 --> 00:09:22.194
The stepped up activity

00:09:22.194 --> 00:09:23.462
among the senior civilian

00:09:23.462 --> 00:09:24.463
and military staff

00:09:24.463 --> 00:09:25.631
Wolf, we can still hear

00:09:25.631 --> 00:09:27.233
John Holliman in Baghdad

00:09:27.233 --> 00:09:28.801
and we'll go listen in.

00:09:28.801 --> 00:09:31.237
He can't hear me, but we can hear him.

00:09:31.237 --> 00:09:31.637
All right.

00:09:31.637 --> 00:09:32.338
We're told,

00:09:32.338 --> 00:09:33.739
David, a miracle has happened.

00:09:33.739 --> 00:09:35.708
We are now able to hear you as well.

00:09:35.708 --> 00:09:36.175
My colleague

00:09:36.175 --> 00:09:38.711
Peter Arnett and I are here at our CNN

00:09:38.711 --> 00:09:39.812
Baghdad bureau.

00:09:39.812 --> 00:09:40.880
You have no idea,

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:41.480
David French,

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:44.283
how nice it is to hear your voice on this

00:09:44.283 --> 00:09:45.284
remarkable night.

00:09:45.284 --> 00:09:47.520
Peter, let's let's tell our viewers

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:49.589
what what's happened here.

00:09:49.589 --> 00:09:51.557
You've had a lot of experience with

00:09:51.557 --> 00:09:52.758
with being under attack.

00:09:52.758 --> 00:09:55.127
Of course, in Vietnam and other places.

00:09:55.494 --> 00:09:57.196
The antiaircraft weapons

00:09:57.196 --> 00:09:58.230
in the city center

00:09:58.230 --> 00:10:00.466
where we are living around the government

00:10:00.466 --> 00:10:02.068
buildings erupted and fires.

00:10:02.068 --> 00:10:03.936
I must have been 200 guns firing

00:10:03.936 --> 00:10:05.404
to the sky.

00:10:05.404 --> 00:10:06.238
We did not see

00:10:06.238 --> 00:10:07.707
any aircraft around,

00:10:07.707 --> 00:10:09.809
but we did hear the alarm sirens.

00:10:10.142 --> 00:10:12.244
About 2 minutes after that,

00:10:12.244 --> 00:10:13.512
there were loud explosions

00:10:13.512 --> 00:10:14.313
and obviously

00:10:14.313 --> 00:10:16.048
bombing in at least three parts

00:10:16.048 --> 00:10:17.516
of the outskirts of the city.

00:10:17.516 --> 00:10:19.552
We have no idea what those targets were,

00:10:19.552 --> 00:10:21.020
but they were in the direction

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:21.721
of the airport

00:10:21.721 --> 00:10:23.222
and some military barracks

00:10:23.222 --> 00:10:23.889
And the

00:10:23.889 --> 00:10:25.958
bombing has not come in this far yet.

00:10:26.325 --> 00:10:29.095
The attack did begin about 2:30 a.m.

00:10:29.095 --> 00:10:29.895
our time now

00:10:29.895 --> 00:10:31.430
here in the hotel,

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:33.733
the Al-Rasheed Hotel, where we are.

00:10:33.733 --> 00:10:35.134
There was some indication

00:10:35.134 --> 00:10:36.268
earlier this evening

00:10:36.268 --> 00:10:37.870
some of our colleagues

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:38.804
received calls

00:10:38.804 --> 00:10:40.773
from friends who said tonight,

00:10:40.773 --> 00:10:42.808
maybe the night Peter the

00:10:43.209 --> 00:10:44.510
for the multinational force

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:45.811
to begin at strike,

00:10:45.811 --> 00:10:48.214
Peter O'Neill had to strike against Iraq.

00:10:48.214 --> 00:10:50.116
And tonight it has come John.

00:10:50.116 --> 00:10:50.916
That's right, Peter.

00:10:50.916 --> 00:10:52.284
I think it would be good for those of us

00:10:52.284 --> 00:10:53.352
in Baghdad

00:10:53.352 --> 00:10:55.287
to turn off our microphone

00:10:55.287 --> 00:10:56.322
for just a moment.

00:10:56.322 --> 00:10:57.623
We have our CNN colleagues,

00:10:57.623 --> 00:10:59.025
of course, all over the world.

00:10:59.025 --> 00:10:59.959
Perhaps, David, France

00:10:59.959 --> 00:11:02.094
may be able to tell us as much about

00:11:02.094 --> 00:11:02.828
what they know

00:11:02.828 --> 00:11:04.063
about this potential attack

00:11:04.063 --> 00:11:04.630
as we can tell.

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:06.499
Looking out our window,

00:11:06.499 --> 00:11:06.799
John,

00:11:06.799 --> 00:11:08.100
I think you might have thrown it to me.

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:08.801
I couldn't tell.

00:11:08.801 --> 00:11:09.535
But if you did,

00:11:09.535 --> 00:11:11.971
we have a radio pool report in from

00:11:12.605 --> 00:11:13.372
John Bascom.

00:11:13.372 --> 00:11:15.307
He's reporting that a squadron of F-15

00:11:15.307 --> 00:11:15.641
fighter

00:11:15.641 --> 00:11:16.742
bombers has taken off

00:11:16.742 --> 00:11:19.011
from a base in central Saudi Arabia.

00:11:19.478 --> 00:11:20.613
The fighter is designed

00:11:20.613 --> 00:11:22.448
for a long range bombing at night

00:11:22.448 --> 00:11:24.183
where completely loaded with bombs,

00:11:24.183 --> 00:11:25.918
according to this report, with missiles

00:11:25.918 --> 00:11:27.987
and with 20 millimeter guns.

00:11:27.987 --> 00:11:29.155
I was looking out the window

00:11:29.155 --> 00:11:30.723
earlier, John and oh, Peter,

00:11:30.723 --> 00:11:31.190
look over here.

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:33.192
There is a sky is lighting up,

00:11:33.192 --> 00:11:34.860
I guess, to the south.

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:36.996
So that aircraft fire some as bright

00:11:37.363 --> 00:11:40.266
red other as flashes of yellow light.

00:11:40.733 --> 00:11:42.001
What seems clear is

00:11:42.001 --> 00:11:43.769
that city is well defended

00:11:43.769 --> 00:11:45.538
with that aircraft fire.

00:11:45.538 --> 00:11:47.273
And we can only presume

00:11:47.273 --> 00:11:49.608
that because they have started up again

00:11:49.608 --> 00:11:51.544
with considerable rapidity

00:11:51.544 --> 00:11:53.479
that there is another attack coming in.

00:11:53.479 --> 00:11:54.847
We just heard, Wolf.

00:11:54.847 --> 00:11:55.915
Holy cow.

00:11:55.915 --> 00:11:58.017
That was a large airburst that we saw.

00:11:58.284 --> 00:12:00.419
There was a feeling the sky was not.

00:12:00.619 --> 00:12:02.755
And I think, John, that airburst took out

00:12:03.089 --> 00:12:05.024
the telecommunications

00:12:05.024 --> 00:12:07.059
that you might hear a lot about.

00:12:07.059 --> 00:12:08.094
If you're still with us,

00:12:08.094 --> 00:12:08.994
you're going to hear the bombs.

00:12:08.994 --> 00:12:10.262
Now, they are hitting

00:12:10.262 --> 00:12:11.597
the center of the city.

00:12:26.011 --> 00:12:28.080
Where crowds find a window and a hill.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:30.116
We're about three miles

00:12:30.116 --> 00:12:30.483
from where

00:12:30.483 --> 00:12:31.951
the center of action at this point

00:12:31.951 --> 00:12:33.018
seems to be.

00:12:33.018 --> 00:12:33.986
It's good to have a colleague

00:12:33.986 --> 00:12:35.488
like Peter Arnett to help out.

00:12:35.488 --> 00:12:36.122
I'll tell you that

00:12:36.122 --> 00:12:37.590
by my experience

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:39.391
of being under attack is very limited,

00:12:39.391 --> 00:12:40.760
I'm proud to say.

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:41.560
But I think by the time

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:42.228
the sun comes up

00:12:42.228 --> 00:12:42.628
tomorrow,

00:12:42.628 --> 00:12:44.363
my experience will be much improved

00:12:44.363 --> 00:12:45.264
in this regard.

00:12:45.264 --> 00:12:46.198
We have a

00:12:46.298 --> 00:12:47.399
cameraman, Mark Biello,

00:12:47.399 --> 00:12:49.368
by the way, is taking pictures of this

00:12:49.368 --> 00:12:49.869
and is doing

00:12:49.869 --> 00:12:50.202
we're able

00:12:50.202 --> 00:12:51.771
to establish a

00:12:51.771 --> 00:12:52.705
video link to you,

00:12:52.705 --> 00:12:54.340
which we're sure won't be anytime soon.

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:55.541
But will be hours from now,

00:12:55.541 --> 00:12:56.842
will be able to show you the pictures

00:12:56.842 --> 00:12:59.311
that we're talking about right now.

00:12:59.311 --> 00:13:00.079
John and Peter,

00:13:00.079 --> 00:13:01.080
we're going to the White House

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:01.981
for just a minute.

00:13:01.981 --> 00:13:03.048
Presidential spokesman

00:13:03.048 --> 00:13:05.151
Marlin Fitzwater is about to address

00:13:05.151 --> 00:13:06.952
the nation and therefore the world

00:13:09.688 --> 00:13:10.623
I have a statement by

00:13:10.623 --> 00:13:13.392
the president of the United States

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:16.829
The liberation of Kuwait has begun

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:18.864
in conjunction

00:13:18.864 --> 00:13:19.532
with the forces

00:13:19.532 --> 00:13:21.467
of our coalition partners.

00:13:21.467 --> 00:13:22.768
The United States has moved

00:13:22.768 --> 00:13:25.471
under the codename Operation Desert Storm

00:13:26.138 --> 00:13:27.506
to enforce the mandates

00:13:27.506 --> 00:13:30.342
of the United Nations Security Council

00:13:30.342 --> 00:13:32.311
as a 7:00 p.m.

00:13:32.311 --> 00:13:34.980
Eastern Standard Time, Operation Desert

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:36.916
Storm forces were engaging targets

00:13:36.916 --> 00:13:39.051
in Kuwait and Iraq.

00:13:39.051 --> 00:13:39.718
President Bush

00:13:39.718 --> 00:13:41.821
will address the nation at 9:00 p.m.

00:13:41.821 --> 00:13:44.256
tonight from the Oval Office.

00:13:44.256 --> 00:13:45.157
I'll try to get you more

00:13:45.157 --> 00:13:46.058
as soon as we can.

00:13:46.058 --> 00:13:48.394
Thank you very much, Carol.

00:13:48.394 --> 00:13:50.930
There we go.

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:52.331
Okay, Peter, we're back.

00:13:52.331 --> 00:13:54.033
I think what is most interesting to me,

00:13:54.033 --> 00:13:55.534
John, is that these bombs came

00:13:55.534 --> 00:13:58.537
right on target during the Vietnam War.

00:13:58.571 --> 00:13:59.738
There was a major problem

00:13:59.738 --> 00:14:00.306
with bombing

00:14:00.306 --> 00:14:01.540
targets in North Vietnam,

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:03.642
and many bridges survived for years.

00:14:03.642 --> 00:14:05.711
Tonight, every bomb we've seen line

00:14:05.778 --> 00:14:07.413
seem to have hit something.

00:14:07.413 --> 00:14:09.481
They have the laser directed

00:14:10.583 --> 00:14:12.484
the way the guided

00:14:12.484 --> 00:14:13.419
bomb systems

00:14:13.419 --> 00:14:14.653
now, which seem to be proving

00:14:14.653 --> 00:14:16.288
effective here tonight.

00:14:22.261 --> 00:14:23.929
We've been waiting for this to happen

00:14:23.929 --> 00:14:26.732
since the deadline on the U.N.

00:14:26.932 --> 00:14:29.468
ultimatum passed at 8:00 yesterday

00:14:29.468 --> 00:14:31.070
morning in Baghdad.

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:33.272
And certainly as the day progressed,

00:14:33.572 --> 00:14:34.673
it was clear here

00:14:34.673 --> 00:14:36.275
that the authorities seemed

00:14:36.275 --> 00:14:38.577
to be preparing for some kind of action.

00:14:38.611 --> 00:14:39.778
I'm sure they didn't have

00:14:39.778 --> 00:14:41.413
any kind of advance word.

00:14:41.413 --> 00:14:43.015
But as I speak to you,

00:14:43.015 --> 00:14:44.049
the antiaircraft

00:14:44.049 --> 00:14:46.118
fire has started up again.

00:14:46.118 --> 00:14:48.587
And there is another wave of planes

00:14:48.587 --> 00:14:50.222
presumably coming in.

00:14:50.222 --> 00:14:52.057
We have yet to see the bombs fall,

00:14:52.057 --> 00:14:53.492
that it's the same pattern

00:14:53.492 --> 00:14:54.426
that the previous

00:14:54.426 --> 00:14:55.461
at least three raids

00:14:55.461 --> 00:14:56.829
that we have witnessed

00:14:56.829 --> 00:14:57.796
Wherever you are

00:14:57.796 --> 00:15:00.799
following CNN's coverage of this.

00:15:00.799 --> 00:15:02.067
Our colleagues in Washington

00:15:02.067 --> 00:15:04.003
and our colleagues in Saudi Arabia

00:15:04.003 --> 00:15:06.171
obviously know a lot more than we know.

00:15:06.372 --> 00:15:08.674
But we are on the receiving end of it.

00:15:08.974 --> 00:15:10.509
I just want to add one thing

00:15:10.509 --> 00:15:14.346
to everybody that we are safe, relatively

00:15:14.346 --> 00:15:15.147
speaking, Peter.

00:15:15.147 --> 00:15:17.383
And there is no sense of

00:15:18.417 --> 00:15:19.952
an immediate threat to our lives.

00:15:19.952 --> 00:15:21.487
You can go with that.

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:22.755
I would concur that.

00:15:22.755 --> 00:15:23.856
I think we're safe enough here

00:15:23.856 --> 00:15:24.623
for the time being.

00:15:24.623 --> 00:15:25.291
Within a minute,

00:15:25.291 --> 00:15:27.426
we can get to a shelter downstairs.

00:15:27.426 --> 00:15:30.829
John, it occurs to me that this attack

00:15:31.997 --> 00:15:34.400
is going to just shake

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:37.136
the psyches of the Baghdadi's here.

00:15:37.469 --> 00:15:38.704
This is

00:15:39.171 --> 00:15:40.572
unprecedented,

00:15:40.572 --> 00:15:42.141
and I'm really anxious

00:15:42.141 --> 00:15:43.142
for daybreak to come

00:15:43.142 --> 00:15:44.043
so that

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:44.977
we can get out

00:15:44.977 --> 00:15:47.579
and see what has been wrought here.

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:48.213
All right.

00:15:48.213 --> 00:15:49.682
DAYBREAK is only 4 hours away.

00:15:49.682 --> 00:15:50.249
And if we make it

00:15:50.249 --> 00:15:50.582
that long,

00:15:50.582 --> 00:15:53.185
we'll certainly be able to do that.

00:16:04.596 --> 00:16:06.465
Richard Blystone is standing by

00:16:06.465 --> 00:16:07.099
in Jerusalem.

00:16:07.099 --> 00:16:09.301
The streets are unnaturally quiet.

00:16:09.568 --> 00:16:10.569
The Israeli government,

00:16:10.569 --> 00:16:11.937
of course, does know about it.

00:16:11.937 --> 00:16:12.304
The prime

00:16:12.304 --> 00:16:14.840
minister says he has been informed

00:16:15.074 --> 00:16:17.343
the military will be making a statement

00:16:17.343 --> 00:16:18.377
very soon.

00:16:18.377 --> 00:16:20.579
The radio here now is

00:16:21.547 --> 00:16:23.649
is broadcasting CNN live.

00:16:23.882 --> 00:16:24.750
The foreign ministry

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.552
also is watching CNN.

00:16:26.552 --> 00:16:27.086
A lot of people

00:16:27.086 --> 00:16:29.321
now are getting their news from CNN

00:16:29.321 --> 00:16:31.056
Something has changed over.

00:16:31.056 --> 00:16:32.958
All the lights in the city of Baghdad

00:16:32.958 --> 00:16:35.160
are now out from everything we can tell.

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:35.594
My colleague

00:16:35.594 --> 00:16:36.495
Bernie Shaw is with me

00:16:36.495 --> 00:16:37.796
as we look out

00:16:37.796 --> 00:16:38.831
in the now dark city

00:16:38.831 --> 00:16:40.099
it's absolutely pitch black.

00:16:40.099 --> 00:16:41.533
We are confined to the hotel.

00:16:41.533 --> 00:16:42.901
We can give this report tonight

00:16:42.901 --> 00:16:44.069
because we're on the ninth floor

00:16:44.069 --> 00:16:45.738
of the Al-Rashid Hotel,

00:16:45.738 --> 00:16:47.106
which has a commanding view

00:16:47.106 --> 00:16:47.773
of this

00:16:47.773 --> 00:16:49.541
very flat city to the north,

00:16:49.541 --> 00:16:51.176
south, east and west.

00:16:51.176 --> 00:16:52.945
And for about the last 2 hours,

00:16:52.945 --> 00:16:55.014
there has been enormous activity.

00:16:55.514 --> 00:16:56.815
And now we hear planes

00:16:56.815 --> 00:16:58.283
actually going over here Yeah.

00:16:58.283 --> 00:17:00.285
Well, I'll see if I can see anything.

00:17:00.285 --> 00:17:00.953
All right.

00:17:01.253 --> 00:17:03.522
The plane there, by burning this up,

00:17:03.522 --> 00:17:03.922
right?

00:17:03.922 --> 00:17:05.958
It's broken out on either side of us

00:17:06.759 --> 00:17:08.494
here at the hotel.

00:17:08.494 --> 00:17:09.361
And I'm just going to

00:17:09.361 --> 00:17:10.562
be quiet and let you listen

00:17:32.117 --> 00:17:33.285
This is the heaviest rate

00:17:33.285 --> 00:17:35.187
so far, so close in.

00:17:35.187 --> 00:17:36.021
Maybe the outskirts

00:17:36.021 --> 00:17:37.222
have been pounded this way,

00:17:37.222 --> 00:17:39.658
but certainly several planes came

00:17:39.658 --> 00:17:41.126
right over the hotel

00:17:41.126 --> 00:17:41.960
and hit targets

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:44.029
within a mile and a half of us.

00:17:44.029 --> 00:17:44.797
Bernie, what do you see

00:17:44.797 --> 00:17:46.365
in the other side of the hotel?

00:17:46.365 --> 00:17:48.367
I just come back from the other side.

00:17:48.367 --> 00:17:50.002
I'm really wearing our trousers

00:17:50.002 --> 00:17:52.271
here, crawling on my knees and hands

00:17:52.271 --> 00:17:53.739
like gentleman.

00:17:53.739 --> 00:17:54.706
Does it occur to you

00:17:54.706 --> 00:17:56.241
that it is not accidental,

00:17:56.241 --> 00:17:58.844
that we are still reporting to the world?

00:17:58.844 --> 00:17:59.711
This government has

00:17:59.711 --> 00:18:01.180
a has told us frequently,

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:02.881
including the information minister

00:18:02.881 --> 00:18:04.883
last night, that he wanted the press

00:18:04.883 --> 00:18:05.684
to stay here.

00:18:05.684 --> 00:18:07.553
In fact, he expressed anger

00:18:07.553 --> 00:18:08.854
that some of the press had left.

00:18:08.854 --> 00:18:09.822
He said

00:18:10.022 --> 00:18:11.390
The international press said

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:12.524
it covers human rights.

00:18:12.524 --> 00:18:13.792
It should be here to see what

00:18:13.792 --> 00:18:14.693
the United States,

00:18:14.693 --> 00:18:16.862
the multinational force is going to do.

00:18:16.862 --> 00:18:17.963
Now, I don't see any government

00:18:17.963 --> 00:18:19.765
officials around here tonight

00:18:19.765 --> 00:18:20.466
to assist us,

00:18:20.466 --> 00:18:21.934
but they have said that

00:18:21.934 --> 00:18:23.635
we can work here and up to now.

00:18:23.635 --> 00:18:25.504
This has to be unique

00:18:25.504 --> 00:18:26.805
that we are continuing

00:18:26.805 --> 00:18:29.241
to cover this story, to talk to you.

00:18:29.508 --> 00:18:31.710
Despite a series of major

00:18:32.311 --> 00:18:33.946
impact bombing raids.

00:18:33.946 --> 00:18:35.547
Well, I'm anxious for daylight to come.

00:18:35.547 --> 00:18:37.249
Maybe we can get some visibility.

00:18:37.249 --> 00:18:38.050
You know, look at this.

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:39.818
This is a bright flash of light

00:18:39.818 --> 00:18:40.786
that seems to be

00:18:40.786 --> 00:18:42.888
it came across from north to south

00:18:42.888 --> 00:18:44.857
and even came up here by us in a hotel.

00:18:44.857 --> 00:18:45.891
And there it goes

00:18:45.891 --> 00:18:47.659
by almost like a shooting star.

00:18:47.659 --> 00:18:49.361
But I think that shooting star

00:18:49.361 --> 00:18:51.096
is probably intensifying on air

00:18:53.298 --> 00:18:54.466
Just one comment.

00:18:54.466 --> 00:18:55.734
Clearly, I've never been there,

00:18:55.734 --> 00:18:56.802
but this feels like

00:18:56.802 --> 00:18:58.770
we're in the center of hell.

00:19:00.739 --> 00:19:03.175
We have temporarily lost contact

00:19:03.175 --> 00:19:03.976
with Baghdad.

00:19:03.976 --> 00:19:05.410
I don't wish to alarm anyone.

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:06.912
We did expect to have this

00:19:06.912 --> 00:19:08.147
come in and out.

00:19:08.147 --> 00:19:09.615
But our three correspondent

00:19:09.615 --> 00:19:10.349
Bernard Shaw,

00:19:10.349 --> 00:19:12.518
Peter Arnett and John Holliman

00:19:12.518 --> 00:19:14.253
are there in the Al Rasheed Hotel.

00:19:14.253 --> 00:19:14.987
We expect to

00:19:14.987 --> 00:19:16.021
and we hope to be bringing you

00:19:16.021 --> 00:19:18.524
some more of their reports later

00:19:27.232 --> 00:19:28.167
I'm pleased to report

00:19:28.167 --> 00:19:29.835
that we can go back to Baghdad now

00:19:29.835 --> 00:19:31.570
and our three correspondents there.

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:34.106
Let's see who picks up the phone

00:19:34.173 --> 00:19:36.041
just to explain to our viewers

00:19:36.041 --> 00:19:38.443
why you did not hear from us for

00:19:39.511 --> 00:19:41.380
a nervously long time.

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:42.514
For the past 20 minutes,

00:19:42.514 --> 00:19:44.449
I've been hiding under a table.

00:19:44.449 --> 00:19:45.817
And what happened was

00:19:45.817 --> 00:19:47.553
the security people made a sweep.

00:19:47.553 --> 00:19:49.221
They got very upset

00:19:49.221 --> 00:19:49.955
that there were

00:19:49.955 --> 00:19:52.224
three mortars on this floor,

00:19:52.224 --> 00:19:54.560
just three men standing in a hotel room.

00:19:54.826 --> 00:19:57.596
So I scampered to hide to make sure

00:19:57.596 --> 00:19:59.998
that if they pulled Arnett and Holman out

00:20:00.032 --> 00:20:01.500
and took them downstairs,

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:02.100
indicated

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:03.468
they at least there would still be one

00:20:03.468 --> 00:20:05.537
CNN person on the air, John.

00:20:05.537 --> 00:20:06.805
The same thing you did, Bernie, on air.

00:20:06.805 --> 00:20:07.773
I hid under a bed.

00:20:07.773 --> 00:20:09.274
And it's amazing that somebody large

00:20:09.274 --> 00:20:09.641
is able

00:20:09.641 --> 00:20:10.409
to get under a bed

00:20:10.409 --> 00:20:11.343
that close to the ground.

00:20:11.343 --> 00:20:12.511
But I was able to do it at least.

00:20:12.511 --> 00:20:14.012
And the security guards

00:20:14.012 --> 00:20:15.781
also took some of the videotape

00:20:15.781 --> 00:20:16.748
out of one of our cameras.

00:20:16.748 --> 00:20:19.418
We basically will get it back tomorrow.

00:20:19.418 --> 00:20:21.053
I'm a little skeptical that we will,

00:20:21.053 --> 00:20:22.621
but it was the beautiful pictures

00:20:22.621 --> 00:20:23.455
that we took to go

00:20:23.455 --> 00:20:24.489
along with the commentary

00:20:24.489 --> 00:20:26.858
that you heard earlier tonight on CNN.

00:20:26.858 --> 00:20:29.161
You keep using that word beautiful.

00:20:29.161 --> 00:20:30.662
It is not beautiful to me.

00:20:41.573 --> 00:20:41.807
Yes.

00:20:41.807 --> 00:20:43.141
2 hours ago,

00:20:43.141 --> 00:20:44.643
Allied air forces began

00:20:44.643 --> 00:20:46.511
an attack on military targets

00:20:46.511 --> 00:20:48.780
in Iraq, in Kuwait,

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:51.216
These attacks continue as I speak.

00:20:52.017 --> 00:20:55.320
Ground forces are not engaged tonight.

00:20:55.921 --> 00:20:57.756
28 nations.

00:20:57.756 --> 00:20:59.791
Countries from five continents,

00:20:59.791 --> 00:21:01.393
Europe and Asia, Africa

00:21:01.393 --> 00:21:02.928
and the Arab League

00:21:02.928 --> 00:21:05.330
have forces in the Gulf area

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:07.299
standing shoulder to shoulder against

00:21:07.299 --> 00:21:09.301
Saddam Hussein.

00:21:09.301 --> 00:21:10.802
These countries had hoped

00:21:10.802 --> 00:21:13.438
the use of force could be avoided.

00:21:13.438 --> 00:21:15.807
Regrettably, we now believe

00:21:16.608 --> 00:21:19.444
that only force will make him leave

00:21:21.313 --> 00:21:23.448
I've told the American people before

00:21:23.882 --> 00:21:26.885
that this will not be another Vietnam.

00:21:28.153 --> 00:21:30.522
And I repeat this here tonight.

00:21:30.522 --> 00:21:32.190
Our troops will have the best

00:21:32.190 --> 00:21:34.660
possible support in the entire world,

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:37.829
and they will not be asked to fight.

00:21:38.363 --> 00:21:41.133
With one hand tied behind their back

00:21:43.201 --> 00:21:45.070
we have no argument

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:47.339
with the people of Iraq.

00:21:47.339 --> 00:21:49.508
Indeed, for the innocents

00:21:50.442 --> 00:21:52.177
caught in this conflict,

00:21:52.177 --> 00:21:53.912
I pray for their safety.

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:55.814
Our goal

00:21:55.814 --> 00:21:57.949
is not the conquest of Iraq.

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:02.154
It is the liberation of Kuwait.

00:22:06.725 --> 00:22:09.728
In Iran and Baghdad, Iraq.

00:22:10.095 --> 00:22:13.532
17 hours after the bombing

00:22:17.369 --> 00:22:18.704
focused on the Alamo,

00:22:18.704 --> 00:22:19.204
as Bernie

00:22:19.204 --> 00:22:20.806
Shaw and myself, Peter Arnett,

00:22:20.806 --> 00:22:23.642
who is signing off from Baghdad for CNN.

00:22:23.642 --> 00:22:24.743
And I hope we can resume

00:22:24.743 --> 00:22:25.977
our communication with you

00:22:25.977 --> 00:22:28.080
in the very near future.

00:22:30.315 --> 00:22:31.516
The best reporting that

00:22:31.516 --> 00:22:33.352
I've seen on what transpired in

00:22:33.352 --> 00:22:36.054
Baghdad is on CNN.

00:22:52.871 --> 00:22:54.306
In West Berlin.

00:22:54.373 --> 00:22:55.240
Jason?

00:22:55.674 --> 00:22:57.242
There are no words,

00:22:57.242 --> 00:22:59.644
no history, United States.

00:22:59.978 --> 00:23:02.581
Osama bin Laden, you exclusion.

00:23:02.581 --> 00:23:03.882
Donald Trump wins.

00:23:03.882 --> 00:23:06.585
It's a hoax. Why am I under arrest?

